  "source": "Theorem:\ngiven: x, y, u, v is \\set\nthen: \\pair:of{x, y} = \\pair:of{u, v}\niff:\n. x = u\n. y = v\nDocumented:\n. called: \"coordinate equality for ordered pairs\"\n. description: \"Kuratowski ordered pairs are equal exactly when their\n                corresponding coordinates are equal.\"\nId: \"31691bb2-e8e1-4218-be4f-759add2b7ab7\"",
